    // STOP. Convoke substitutes a tap for a single mana symbol of the total cost —
    // "For each colored mana in this spell's total cost, you may tap an untapped
    // creature of that color you control rather than pay that mana" [CR#702.51a].
    // `Cost` has no per-symbol payment alternative; `StaticSpec::AltCost` replaces a
    // whole cost.
    body: Keyword(keyword: "Convoke", params: [], body: []),
)
